==Belarusian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|be}} {{m|sla-pro|*čьto}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|be}} {{m|ine-pro|*kʷid}}, {{m|ine-pro|*kʷis}}.  Cognates include {{etyl|uk|-}} {{term|що|lang=uk}}, {{etyl|ru|-}} {{term|что|lang=ru}} and {{etyl|pl|-}} {{term|co|lang=pl}}.

===Conjunction===
{{head|be|conjunction|tr=što}}

# [[that]]

===Pronoun===
{{head|be|pronoun|tr=što}}

# ''(relative pronoun)'' [[that]], [[which]]
# ''(interrogative pronoun)'' [[what]]

====Declension====
{{be-decl-noun-unc|што|чаго́|чаму́|што|чым|чым}}

